            <div xml:id="d595">

                <pb facs="0835" n="755" xml:id="pg755"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">647.116/147a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Consul at Melbourne</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Dye</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1936-06-01T14:00:00-04:00">June 1, 1936—2
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>For Moffat. You may use the sense of my May 27, 5 p.m. in any conversations you
                    have but not for publication at the present time. You may, however, keep the
                    idea in mind and let us have any suggestions you may have with regard to
                    publicity if you consider it advisable.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
